        "title": "DC Act Master API",
        "description": "Every Act is provided by unique National Act Code . API provides list of the Acts and relevant National Act Codes used in the eCourts project for further accessing relevant API s. This API doesn\u2019t require any input string and can just be connected using dept_id & token to get the list of all the Acts with the respective National Act codes."
